+There is also no Stage 5 candidate.
+
+I reran `tools.klean_preflight.check_generation` with
+`PYTHONPATH=/reference` against the mandated three inputs. It returned:
+
+- status `KLEAN_NO_OBLIGATIONS`;
+- obligation count `0`;
+- target `null`;
